Output src/generated/increment_numbers.mp4
Require nvim

Hide
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Type "nvim --clean src/generated/increment_numbers.text"
Enter
Show

Ctrl+"a"
Type "j"
Ctrl+"a"
Type "j"
Ctrl+"a"

Escape

Hide
Type ":w!"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2s